**Daisuke.** A shallow celebrity singer cursed to transform into a
rabbit at a woman's romantic touch. A wealthy, womanizing pop idol,
Daisuke rudely dismissed an elderly fan who asked for an autograph --
and she cursed him on the spot. Now any woman's amorous touch turns
him into a handsome black rabbit until he escapes her sight, clothes
and all left behind. Chastened but hardly reformed, he's determined to
track the old woman down and get the curse lifted. Lecherous,
self-absorbed, and far too famous for his own good, Daisuke's biggest
problems are entirely of his own making -- when he isn't chasing
girls, he's complaining about his food. *Agile +2, Attack (Kung Faux)
+1, Beautiful +2, Combat Expert +1, Famous +3, Knowledge (Motorcycles)
+2, Performer +3, Quick +1, Vigorous +1, Wealthy +3; Accidental
Transformation (Black Bunny) -3, Impulsive -1, Lecherous -2, Love
Interest (Himself) -1, Love Magnet -3, Overconfident -1, Quirk (Odd
Food Demands) -1, Rude -1, Weak-Willed -1.* Crouching Rabbit, Hidden
Bunny (Affinity: Martial Arts): Roll 5, DX 2, End 0. Daisuke's
fondness for martial arts movies has led to spending megabucks on
tutors. This Axe Goes to 11! (Effective x3; Ammunition x3): Roll 5, DX
5, End 0. In desperation, Daisuke can sacrifice his guitar to save his
hide…. Defense 3. Health 40, Endurance 50. TV 11.

